WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.968
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.036
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:07.540
♪♪

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.475
This is exciting.
As of today,

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:11.344
all Americans 16 and older

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.846
are now eligible
for the COVID vaccine.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:14.914
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:18.551
♪♪

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.854 line:0%
And yet the biggest thing
trending online today was this.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:25.925 line:0%
-McDonald's partnering with
popular Korean pop band BTS.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:28.395 line:0%
The celebrity meal
goes on sale next month.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.295 line:0%
The meal features
10-piece chicken nuggets,

00:00:30.295 --> 00:00:31.998 line:0%
medium fries, and a Coke.

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:35.601 line:0%
The fast food chain also
debuting two new dipping sauces.

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:36.669
-Yeah.
-Wow.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.103
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.103 --> 00:00:40.473
-Just so there's no confusion,
you get your BTS order

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.409
at McDonald's, and you get your
IBS order at White Castle.

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.912
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:48.815
-This is odd, but my nickname
at my local McDonald's is BTS

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:51.217
'cause whenever I order, they
think it's for seven people.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.286
[ Laughter ]
"Uh, give me a number three,

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.321
and, uh -- you guys
still making pancakes?"

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.590
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.391
I might throw
a couple of those in there."

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.094
-"What do you want?
What did you want?"

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:03.062
-Doing different voices.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.396
-"I'll have three small..."

00:01:04.396 --> 00:01:06.799
-[ Russia accent ] "I would
like to get a Big Mac."

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.167
It's like, "Oh."
-"He wants a Big Mac, too."

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:11.136
-That's my Russian buddy.
-"And some fries!"

00:01:11.136 --> 00:01:13.105
-Of course, adding the BTS name
to McDonald's

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.540
will drum up a lot of business,

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.508
but if BTS really wants
to impress me,

00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:18.611
they'll put their name on
the Johnson &amp; Johnson vaccine.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:19.712
That's what I'm talking about.
-Yeah.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.115
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:23.382
-Well, guys,
now that the vaccine

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:25.618
is open to all Americans
16 and older,

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.488
the Biden administration
is trying to get the word out.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:30.623 line:0%
Watch this.
-The White House is launching

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.425 line:0%
a media blitz today
to promote the vaccine.

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:35.962 line:0%
-You're gonna be seeing
Dr. Fauci on unlikely forums

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:38.497 line:0%
such as Snapchat,
and the administration is also

00:01:38.497 --> 00:01:40.166 line:0%
gonna be using
Facebook and Twitter

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.069 line:0%
to send push notifications
to Americans to let them know

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:45.472 line:0%
that it's their turn
to get vaccinated.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:49.075
-So let me get this straight.
Your idea to get kids vaccinated

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.410
is putting an 80-year-old
scientist on TikTok?

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.147
[ Laughter ]
Good luck.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:55.481
You know Biden's old
when he's like,

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:59.852
"We need someone young and hip
for the Snapchat videos.

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:04.824
How about that kid, Dr. Fauci?"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.360
Meanwhile, I read that a lot
of singles have been meeting

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.695 line:0%
while waiting in line
to get their vaccines.

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.997 line:0%
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:14.567
That's really sweet until that
moment when the masks come off.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.101
Like...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.101 --> 00:02:18.638
"We're good.
We're good."

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.139
You know someone didn't like you
when they skipped

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.308
their second dose just to avoid
seeing you again.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.877
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.547
Today, one guy in Rite Aid
was like, "Care to continue this

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.048
over by
the blood pressure machine?"

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.282
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.282 --> 00:02:31.917
All I know is,
we're probably days away

00:02:31.917 --> 00:02:34.921 line:0%
from the new Hallmark movie,
"Moderna Love."

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.589 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:37.857 line:0%
Well, this is exciting.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.660 line:0%
Earlier this morning,
NASA made history on Mars.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.994 line:0%
Check it out.

00:02:41.994 --> 00:02:45.231 line:0%
-NASA is celebrating yet another
historic accomplishment

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:47.867 line:0%
on the red planet,
successfully flying

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:50.035 line:0%
a mini helicopter on Mars.

00:02:50.035 --> 00:02:53.572 line:0%
It's the first-ever powered
flight on another planet.

00:02:53.572 --> 00:02:55.308
-That's right.
A little helicopter

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:59.045
detached from a rover, and now
they're both exploring Mars.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:00.980
Or as Pixar put it, "Sold!"

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.649
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:05.184
The flight lasted a total
of 30 seconds.

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:07.420
The men on the team said
it was a complete success

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:10.022
while the women agreed so they
wouldn't hurt anyone's feelings.

00:03:10.022 --> 00:03:14.160
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.128
I saw that --
-Wow.

00:03:16.128 --> 00:03:19.332
-I saw that Tinder user--
I saw that Tinder users

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:22.368
can get free lessons
on the language app Duolingo

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:25.538
so they can meet other
international singles.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:28.173
It's amazing. The program
teaches you how to say "You up?"

00:03:28.173 --> 00:03:30.209
in 40 different languages.
Unbelievable.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:31.911
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:34.180
Well, guys,
big sports news from overseas.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.915
Some of the world's
best soccer clubs

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:37.750
