to form a Super League.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:46.792 line:0%
Some of the wealthiest and most
successful teams from England,

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:51.097 line:0%
Spain, and Italy say they plan
to form an exclusive new league

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:53.699 line:0%
