only amongst themselves.

00:03:53.699 --> 00:03:55.868
-Right now, America's
thinking, "Whatever,"
while Europe's like --

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.002
[ English accent ]
Forget the virus.

00:03:57.002 --> 00:03:58.838
This is the biggest threat
