out onto Snapchat.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.353
-Really?
-Yeah, exactly.

00:04:14.353 --> 00:04:16.722
-Wow!
-Some political news.

00:04:16.722 --> 00:04:18.724
A new poll shows
Matthew McConaughey

00:04:18.724 --> 00:04:22.028 line:0%
