00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:46.719 line:0%
will always support
the party of Lincoln.

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:50.055 line:0%
Correct?
-Nice, nice. Nice.

00:04:50.055 --> 00:04:52.158
-Thank you, Higgins.
Historian.

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:53.458
-Yep.
-So you appreciate that humor.

00:04:53.458 --> 00:04:55.027
-I appreciate --
I appreciate that.

00:04:55.027 --> 00:04:56.528
Also, he did
"The Lincoln Lawyer," too,

00:04:56.528 --> 00:04:58.564
