-The same lawyer.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.305
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:08.741
-Nicer car.
-Yeah.

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:10.242
Some entertainment news.
It was just announced

00:05:10.242 --> 00:05:12.945 line:0%
