[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.862 --> 00:06:07.566
Seems like Johnson &amp; Johnson
just can't catch a break.

00:06:07.566 --> 00:06:09.535
Listen to this.
Back in March,

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:10.936 line:0%
