not talking to Johnson.

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.467
It's that bad.

00:06:42.467 --> 00:06:43.870
Well, guys, some big tech news.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.872
Today was Apple's
"Spring Loaded" event,

00:06:46.872 --> 00:06:49.041
