00:07:12.398 --> 00:07:14.133
Yep, they unveiled the
purple iPhone

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:18.871
or, as people celebrating 4/20
put it, "Purple?"

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:21.440
That's right.
Today is 4/20.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.541
I --

00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:26.512
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:30.082
