Watch this.

00:07:50.169 --> 00:07:51.838 line:0%
-Today is what you might call

00:07:51.838 --> 00:07:55.942 line:0%
a very unofficial
American holiday -- 4/20.

00:07:55.942 --> 00:08:00.780
[ Laughter ]

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.481
-This clip feels
exactly like the moment

00:08:02.481 --> 00:08:04.149
